on the arrangement. In some cases the buyer takes inventory with the account. We'll discuss the best approach during valuation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What information do you need from me?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Initially just basic account details: age, monthly revenue range, primary categories, feedback score, and brand registration status. No login credentials needed until you accept an offer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens to my personal information after the sale?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Control of the account and its selling rights move to the buyer. Banking and tax details are typically updated to the buyer's, though some original account information (such as the registered name) can remain in place. Credentials are handed over securely."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I sell a suspended or deactivated account?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Accounts with minor, resolvable issues may still have value. Permanent deactivations are generally not eligible. Share your status and we'll let you know upfront."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you handle Walmart accounts too?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we also connect sellers with buyers for Walmart seller accounts. Visit our Walmart account page for details."}}]}</script><section class="pg-hero bg-shades"><div class="pgx-391"><nav class="pgx-392"><a href="index.php">Home</a><span class="pg-crumbs__sep">›</span><a href="services.php">Services</a><span class="pg-crumbs__sep">›</span><span class="pgx-1">Sell Amazon Seller Account</span></nav><div class="pgx-393"><div><h1 class="pgx-394">Sell Your Amazon<!-- --> <span class="gradient-text pgi-186">Seller Account</span></h1><p class="pgx-395">Ready to move on from your Amazon business? We connect you with vetted buyers for aged U.S. Amazon seller accounts. Fair valuations, fast payment, and a secure, documented transfer, completed directly with the buyer.</p><div class="pgx