Buyer pays via ACH, typically within 5 business days of transfer</p></div><div class="pgx-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-86 lucide lucide-handshake pgx-689" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4"></path><path d="m21 3 1 11h-2"></path><path d="M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="M3 4h8"></path></svg><h3 class="pgx-401">No Obligation</h3><p class="pgx-342">Free valuation, no commitment until you accept</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-309 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-402"><div class="pgx-46"><h2 class="pgx-403">What Makes an Account Valuable</h2><p class="pgx-404">These factors determine your account’s market value</p></div><div class="pgx-405"><div class="pgx-406"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-407 lucide lucide-clock pgx-689" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg><h3 class="pgx-408">Account Age</h3><p class="pgx-409">Older accounts with established selling history are more valuable. We look for accounts that are at least 6 months old.</p></div><div class="pgx-406"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-407 lucide lucide-star pgx-689" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg><h3 class="pgx-408">Feedback &amp; Ratings</h3><p class="pgx-409">Positive seller feedback and strong performance metrics increase account value significantly.</p></div><div class="pgx-406"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-407 lucide lucide-chart-column pgx-689" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg><h3 class="pgx-408">Sales History</h3><p class="pgx-409">Consistent sales volume and revenue history demonstrate a proven, active store.</p></div><div class="pgx-406"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-407 lucide lucide-shield-check pgx-689" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="pgx-408">Account Health</h3><p class="pgx-409">Clean account standing with no active policy violations, suspensions, or unresolved performance issues.</p></div><div class="pgx-406"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-407 lucide lucide-file-check pgx-689" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="pgx-408">Category Approvals</h3><p class="pgx-409">Ungated categories (especially restricted ones like grocery, beauty, or health) increase value substantially.</p></div><div class="pgx-406"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-407 lucide lucide-dollar-sign pgx-689" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg><h3 class="pgx-408">Brand Registry</h3><p class="pgx-409">Brand-registered accounts with trademark protections command premium pricing.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-305 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-410"><h2 class="pgx-411">How Ecom Circles Works: Trusted Introductions to Vetted Buyers</h2><div class="pgx-412"><p class="pgx-96">Ecom Circles connects you with the right buyer for your Amazon seller account. We maintain a private network of vetted buyers, value your account against real market data, and introduce you to a buyer who fits. We do not buy the accounts ourselves. The sale is completed directly with the vetted buyer.</p></div><div class="pgx-345"><p>The value is in the introduction. Listing your account on a public forum or marketplace means tire-kickers, lowball scammers, and no idea who you are handing your business to. We have spent since 2020 building a network of buyers we trust, so the person you are introduced to is real, verified, and actually ready to buy.</p><p>One conversation with us beats weeks of vetting strangers on your own. We bring you a matched buyer, keep your account details confidential, and the sale stays documented and above-board from start to finish.</p></div><div class="pgx-346"><div class="pgx-347"><h3 class="pgx-348">We vet</h3><p class="pgx-349">Every buyer in our network is vetted. You are introduced to real, verified buyers, not anonymous strangers.</p></div><div class="pgx-347"><h3 class="pgx-348">We value</h3><p class="pgx-349">We assess your account against real market data so you know what it is worth.</p></div><div class="pgx-347"><h3 class="pgx-348">We introduce</h3><p class="pgx-349">We introduce you to a matched buyer, and the sale is completed directly with them.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-305 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-413"><div class="pgx-46"><h2 class="pgx-403">How It Works</h2><p class="pgx-404">From inquiry to payment in five straightforward steps</p></div><div class="pgx-414"><div class="pgx-415"><div class="pgx-416 pgx-690">1</div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">Submit Your Account Details</h3><p class="pgx-417">Fill out our inquiry form with basic account info: age, categories, monthly revenue, and feedback score. No login credentials needed at this stage.</p></div></div><div class="pgx-415"><div class="pgx-416 pgx-690">2</div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">We Review &amp; Value</h3><p class="pgx-417">We assess your account based on age, sales history, category approvals, account health, and market demand, then give you a market-based valuation and match you with vetted buyers in our network looking for accounts like yours.</p></div></div><div class="pgx-415"><div class="pgx-416 pgx-690">3</div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">Agree on Terms</h3><p class="pgx-417">Once you&#x27;re matched with a buyer, you agree on pricing, timeline, and responsibilities directly with them. Everything is documented and above-board.</p></div></div><div class="pgx-415"><div class="pgx-416 pgx-690">4</div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">Secure Account Transfer</h3><p class="pgx-417">You and the buyer follow Amazon&#x27;s official account transfer process with all required documentation. The transfer is handled professionally with full compliance.</p></div></div><div class="pgx-415"><div class="pgx-416 pgx-690">5</div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">Get Paid</h3><p class="pgx-417">The buyer pays you, typically via ACH transfer, once the account transfer is confirmed and verified. Most sellers receive payment within 5 business days of completion.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-309 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-413"><div class="pgx-46"><h2 class="pgx-403">Why Sell Through Ecom Circles</h2></div><div class="pgx-418"><div><div class="pgx-31"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-419 lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><h3 class="pgx-348">Vetted Buyer Network</h3><p class="pgx-420">Since 2020 we&#x27;ve built a private network of vetted buyers. You&#x27;re not posting to an anonymous marketplace. You&#x27;re introduced to a real, verified buyer.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="pgx-31"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-419 lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><h3 class="pgx-348">No Listing Hassle</h3><p class="pgx-420">Skip the back-and-forth of listing your account on forums or marketplaces. No tire-kickers, no scammers. One conversation, and we bring you a matched buyer.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="pgx-31"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-419 lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><h3 class="pgx-348">Confidential Process</h3><p class="pgx-420">Your account details stay between us. We don&#x27;t share your information or broadcast your account for sale publicly.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="pgx-31"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-419 lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><h3 class="pgx-348">Clean Transfer</h3><p class="pgx-420">The transfer follows the official process with full paperwork. Once it&#x27;s done, you&#x27;re fully released from the account with proper documentation.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-305 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-413"><h2 class="pgx-421">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">How much is my Amazon account worth?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Is selling my Amazon account legal?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">How long does the process take?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><spa